  "description": "<p>Middlesex Dubai Campus is an offshore campus of Middlesex University London in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.</p><p>This university has an excellent reputation for innovation and high quality teaching and research. It is Dubaiâ€™s largest UK university for total student enrolments, with over 4,500 students from 118+ nationalities currently studying at the institution. There is a strong student community at Middlesex Dubai Campus.</p><h2>What is the Middlesex University Dubai acceptance rate for International Students?</h2><p>The Middlesex University Dubai acceptance rate is 54%.</p> <p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>The university is located in Dubai Knowledge park so students have access to a wider student community. There are lots of leisure and recreational activities to be enjoyed within the park. A student helpdesk is available on-campus to provide face-to-face support for students.</p><p>The social hub is located within Dubai Knowledge park and contains a games room, dance studio, computer gaming and more. There are many student clubs you can join and plenty of events taking place around campus all year.</p>",
