  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Middlesex University (MDX) Dubai is the first overseas campus of Middlesex University in London. The university opened in Dubai Knowledge Park (DKP) in 2005 and has&nbsp;7,100+&nbsp;students from 120+ nationalities. The Commission for Academic Accreditation (CAA) of the UAE’s Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research (MoHESR) granted MDX Dubai its&nbsp;initial&nbsp;institutional license on 9 January 2025. &nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">In 2021, MDX Dubai expanded to Dubai International Academic City (DIAC), becoming the first international university in Dubai with multi-site campuses.&nbsp;In January 2026, the university opened its&nbsp;Study Hub&nbsp;in Dubai Media City, strengthening its presence at the heart of the city’s innovation and creative industries.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">MDX Dubai&nbsp;offers programmes from foundation to MBA in Business, IT, Law, Media, Fashion and more,&nbsp;blending British education with the diverse culture of Dubai.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Middlesex Dubai Campus is partnered with The Myriad to provide students with affordable and luxurious student accommodation in a new, first-rate student living community located in Dubai Academic City.</p><p>The Myriad offers two pricing packages that include: furnishings, utilities, sporting facilities, onsite laundry facilities, high speed Wi-Fi and broadband, 24/7 security and community features). Students have the opportunity to benefit from being part of a wider student community that encourages socializing in the many common areas, library lounge or leisure facilities and there is a 24/7 office onsite to provide support.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Lab",
      "value": "<p>From a media center to specialist labs and a Dubai knowledge park with lots of food choices around, students can enjoy world class facilities. Prayer rooms are provided for students of different faiths and learning spaces are dotted around for students to use the environment that helps them work best.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Library",
      "value": "<p>The Middlesex University Dubai Library provides a huge database of readily available information to students alongside a relaxing atmosphere in which to study. Workshops and laptop loans are also available to those wishing to utilize the university's great reputation for research.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>The university is located in Dubai Knowledge park so students have access to a wider student community. There are lots of leisure and recreational activities to be enjoyed within the park. A student helpdesk is available on-campus to provide face-to-face support for students.</p><p>The social hub is located within Dubai Knowledge park and contains a games room, dance studio, computer gaming and more. There are many student clubs you can join and plenty of events taking place around campus all year.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
